{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00450","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黄帝宫音 肃和 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黄帝宫音 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眇眇方舆，苍苍圜盖。\n至哉枢纽，宅中图大。\n气调四序，风和万籁。\n祚我明德，时雍道泰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}